def faq():
 items=[('Is State Line Gym open 24/7?','Yes. Members receive 24/7 access to the gym.'),('How much is a day pass?',f'A day pass is $13, available via Venmo or PayPal. {link(tel,"Call Tom at "+phone)} for assistance.'),('How do I get gym access?','After purchasing a membership, you will receive an email with your unique door code, generally within an hour or two. Call Tom if you need access sooner.'),('What equipment is available?','The gym has 8 racks, specialty bars, free weights and equipment for powerlifting, weightlifting and strength training.'),('Can I bring a personal trainer?',f'{link("/contact/?interest=Personal%20Training","Contact Tom")} to discuss personal training and facility access before your visit.'),('Can independent trainers work with clients here?','Yes. Flexible facility-use arrangements may include per-month, per-week or per-session options. Trainer facility use may be free when clients are State Line Gym members. Contact Tom to confirm your arrangement.'),('Where is State Line Gym located?',e(address)+'.'),('Is there parking?',f'{link("/contact/","Contact Tom")} for current parking information before your visit.'),('Can I tour the gym before joining?',f'{link(tel,"Call Tom")} to ask about tour availability and arrange a visit.')]
